WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
We have been at Spacio coworking in Basavanagudi for about one and a half years.

00:08.000 --> 00:20.000
A very good place. The owner is cooperative and we have never had any issues.

00:20.000 --> 00:32.000
People who work here are friendly. It is a cool and calm atmosphere.

00:32.000 --> 00:48.000
We have our own space and are trying to take a bigger space because the place is really good.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Location wise it is ideal — the metro is about a kilometer away, close to Basavanagudi on Vani Vilas Road.

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
They have three floors and vacancies fill quickly. Keep your eyes open if you want a place here.
